        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Nine, 8½\n- People: Rob Marshall, Michael Tolkin, Anthony Minghella, Federico Fellini, Judi Dench\n- Works: the 1982 musical Nine\n- Organizations: Old Vic Company\n\nFacts:\n- Federico Fellini's 1963 film 8½ is semi-autobiographical.\n- Judi Dench was born on 9 December 1934 and is an English actress and author.\n- Judi Dench made her professional debut in 1957 with the Old Vic Company.\n- The 1982 musical Nine is the source work adapted into the 2009 film Nine.\n- The 2009 romantic musical drama film Nine was directed and produced by Rob Marshall.\n- The 2009 film Nine was written by Michael Tolkin and Anthony Minghella.\n- The 2009 film Nine is an adaptation of the 1982 musical of the same name, which is based on Federico Fellini's 1963 film 8½.",
